41
00:04:44.607 --> 00:04:59.395
<v Daniel>Yeah, it's entirely unforgiving. This foundation was 7,578 lines of lean code. And they didn't just guess. They tested it rigorously in lockstep against Unicorn, which is a CPU emulator, and ARM's SAIL</v>

