00:04:59.435 --> 00:04:59.715
<v Daniel>model.</v>

43
00:05:00.055 --> 00:05:03.177
<v Maya>Okay, so the official digital twin of the processor.</v>

44
00:05:03.197 --> 00:05:12.982
<v Daniel>Right. So once the environment is perfect, they bring in the AI workforce. And this is powered by Gemini 4 Carbon and Cloud Opus 5.5.</v>

45
