53
00:06:13.194 --> 00:06:27.778
<v Maya>And the craziest part to me is that no human author wrote a single line of that proof code. Not one line. If you're listening, just think about the historical context here. The famous verified SEL4 microkernel, that took 20 human years of labor. Right.</v>

