00:06:39.782 --> 00:06:41.242
<v Daniel>It's a total paradigm shift.</v>

56
00:06:42.098 --> 00:06:57.051
<v Maya>But OK, here's where it gets really interesting. And we have to talk about the trust problem. Yes. If an AI swarm is writing 6.5 million lines of dense mathematical proof, how do we know the AI didn't just like cheat or hallucinate a workaround to get the job</v>

