70
00:08:16.485 --> 00:08:27.669
<v Daniel>It confirms that the AI's final proof exactly matches a held-out copy of the specification. The proving agents are never allowed to touch or even see this held-out copy.</v>

71
00:08:28.209 --> 00:08:31.470
<v Maya>So they can't sneak in and rewrite the rules of the test while they're taking it.</v>

72
00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:32.251
<v Daniel>Exactly.</v>

73
00:08:32.371 --> 00:08:32.591
<v Maya>Okay.</v>

74
00:08:32.851 --> 00:08:39.153
<v Daniel>The human writes the spec, locks a copy away, and the gatekeeper uses that locked copy to grade the AI's homework.</v>

75
00:08:39.652 --> 00:08:46.219
