76
00:08:46.499 --> 00:08:59.572
<v Daniel>Yes. The first is the symbolic model, which is often called the Dolev-Yau model. In this model, you assume the cryptography is like perfect, unbreakable math boxes. You're testing the logic of the protocol itself.</v>

77
00:08:59.932 --> 00:09:00.253
<v Maya>Got it.</v>

78
00:09:00.952 --> 00:09:07.279
